WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.862
Lab 1.

2
00:00:00.862 --> 00:00:05.876
Step 1 renders the morning of November
sixteenth in the fictional workspace.

3
00:00:05.876 --> 00:00:08.942
The Entra diagnostic setting
stopped at ten past five

4
00:00:08.942 --> 00:00:11.600
the evening before, and
the sync probe didn't run.

5
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:16.944
Telemetry flags four rows: sign-in and
audit logs are dark, the probe's table

6
00:00:16.944 --> 00:00:22.025
is dark, and the Office 365 connector's
latest health event is a failure.

7
00:00:22.025 --> 00:00:27.584
The sync, risk, emergency access, grants
and admin changes tabs are all STALE,

8
00:00:27.584 --> 00:00:31.350
even the sync server's two
overnight export errors.

9
00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:34.841
The Active Directory tab's sources
are fresh, so it can be read:

10
00:00:34.841 --> 00:00:38.820
the third domain controller went
silent at seven the evening before,

11
00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:40.775
and both links from it are failing.

12
00:00:40.775 --> 00:00:43.630
Step 2 shows why the risk tab isn't clear:

13
00:00:43.630 --> 00:00:47.350
no rows, but its source
stopped fourteen hours ago.
